-bb5e-5e7a37815b2e", "type": "concept", "title": "Bench warrants"}, {"id": "8608af2e-3d5c-4b95-aaf2-c85e20ee5164", "type": "concept", "title": "Immigration detainers"}, {"id": "10d7ce10-97f8-4901-b9e0-b79ad238597b", "type": "concept", "title": "Mental health holds"}, {"id": "dfe5655b-3db4-433e-9307-b79bf6db0125", "type": "concept", "title": "High turnover"}, {"id": "12d1555a-d390-4749-80d1-6c2dc5662237", "type": "concept", "title": "Short length of stay"}], "description": "Students learn how jails differ from prisons in mission, turnover, legal status, and services."}, {"id": "d7f9dd6a-ec87-4612-a99a-1e4053181e45", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Pretrial decision-making", "children": [{"id": "86d10911-833c-42f8-84de-031de96efe2e", "type": "concept", "title": "Cash bail"}, {"id": "aaaf3456-6d0f-4256-ba71-0a78c47bab46", "type": "concept", "title": "Release on recognizance"}, {"id": "ce4ac213-07bf-4d32-a0ce-8a561a00c304", "type": "concept", "title": "Pretrial services"}, {"id": "6092d3ca-a0e1-40a0-94f0-f0e838706952", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk assessment"}, {"id": "bd0137aa-4966-422f-9ef6-ef47b8b199fc", "type": "concept", "title": "Failure to appear"}, {"id": "b06ebeb3-00e9-4d04-9988-4ae737b29285", "type": "concept", "title": "Public safety conditions"}, {"id": "a778d145-9d33-4a0f-bcf8-e578b503c504", "type": "concept", "title": "Preventive detention"}, {"id": "0d959e63-b7c9-4425-9c83-fc7d083f5d53", "type": "concept", "title": "Speedy trial"}], "description": "Students examine how bail, risk assessment, court delay, and detention shape outcomes before conviction."}, {"id": "8fb42e4c-375a-438e-b348-d2e46a3bb6bc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Jail management and reform", "children": [{"id": "9636a4c3-5acc-4e2d-8bdc-968a450efa6f", "type": "concept", "title": "Booking"}, {"id": "940e093b-e6b0-4eac-ad47-936c24c8aa83", "type": "concept", "title": "Classification"}, {"id": "e0f9cbf4-abc1-440b-8f28-ce839e7b91ad", "type": "concept", "title": "Medical screening"}, {"id": "