d2e25", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Prison social order", "children": [{"id": "23916a54-783b-4b7b-930d-3ad1323ef2e9", "type": "concept", "title": "Prisonization"}, {"id": "4702f3ef-ecce-469c-b834-20ee06861e94", "type": "concept", "title": "Inmate subculture"}, {"id": "9a0dc57a-a4ea-4181-a179-23ea4fbdb763", "type": "concept", "title": "Gangs and security threat groups"}, {"id": "a3369d49-d050-4203-b76f-b487d1c9767b", "type": "concept", "title": "Informal economy"}, {"id": "24ca5390-3953-400c-951b-820b29a3861f", "type": "concept", "title": "Contraband"}, {"id": "c44357aa-9ac8-41b5-b0fa-15a231c19b5a", "type": "concept", "title": "Staff-inmate relations"}, {"id": "0ea6b983-3929-4e59-b051-316d8c5acae9", "type": "concept", "title": "Collective behavior"}, {"id": "b3f2e018-ff7b-405a-a36d-c668d9b6f470", "type": "concept", "title": "Grievances"}], "description": "The point is to understand how people adapt to confinement and how informal norms affect safety and legitimacy."}, {"id": "7ec5f2c9-287b-4ddc-adef-57d8ee3af7c7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Conditions of confinement", "children": [{"id": "e0765cfb-8612-4fba-990d-fefaa6f9ff1c", "type": "concept", "title": "Housing units"}, {"id": "0b99e53b-1f4b-434f-881e-7a8c01fe308a", "type": "concept", "title": "Meals"}, {"id": "0e88ca0f-db5d-437f-a2cc-49763ff2589a", "type": "concept", "title": "Visitation"}, {"id": "c4b84b2b-7a03-4d9d-8b42-9184532e3447", "type": "concept", "title": "Mail"}, {"id": "9c938d35-5b2a-4252-9895-e397e1e88d7c", "type": "concept", "title": "Phones and tablets"}, {"id": "8ffff6bf-ad09-41e6-b495-566cf5cc0fce", "type": "concept", "title": "Work assignments"}, {"id": "b3cc31f5-9d7c-4fd9-88ed-d1125bceaa67", "type": "concept", "title": "Recreation"}, {"id": "6a3d8968-674b-4462-b61e-168a198e954c", "type": "concept", "title": "Religious practice"}, {"id": "ae3ac52a-da41-44e5-97d4-8e08b3b8c051", "type": "concept", "title": "Access to counsel"}], "description": "Students connect facility operations to human dignity, safety, health, programming, and constitutional claims."}]}, {"id": "46c88030-dd29-4819-8736-28a6a20470e6", "type": "topic", "title": "Correctional Administration, Staffing, and Institutional Management", "description": "Corrections is also an administrative field. Students learn how agencies manage staff, budgets, facilities, risk, discipline, classification, emergencies, and organizational culture.", "children": [{"id": "26eb8ce4-746c-4a3e-9ad4-75ddfe9f3a87", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Agency structure and leadership", "children": [{"id": "5145822b-99e1-446d-8e07-972920bb0177", "type": "concept", "title": "Departments of corrections"}, {"id": "c780811f-d1bb-4d1a-aa99-00c4aa8f3d10", "type": "concept", "title": "Wardens"}, {"id": "7284b572-333c-49d4-a675-4088c862db60", "type": "concept", "title": "Sheriffs"}, {"id": "ab890bd8-370f-4305-9ef9-be3ea014300e", "type": "concept", "title": "Jail administrators"}, {"id": "c46d7c59-41b2-4b26-93d1-e7801ee42c95", "type": "concept", "title": "Chain of command"}, {"id": "45cc507e-66ab-463c-84cf-c92ea037d81f", "type": "concept", "title": "Policy directives"}, {"id": "d91b5392-f17a-45f5-8396-985b563c1fb2", "type": "concept", "title": "Accreditation"}, {"id": "3410473d-42cb-453e-a40a-b6453b9e07cb", "type": "concept", "title": "Strategic planning"}], "description": "Students learn how correctional agencies are organized and how leadership choices shape conditions and outcomes."}, {"id": "e47940d3-51c9-4b11-ab8b-2d3b8696ec8c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Staffing and workforce issues", "children": [{"id": "1943b167-e4f3-4e9a-a1c5-07b60963f3e0", "type": "concept", "title": "Correctional officers"}, {"id": "38344283-5cde-4fba-9370-0f2f23440fe7", "type": "concept", "title": "Case managers"}, {"id": "1a79f883-bfe0-4337-8415-ff27cbcc3a58", "type": "concept", "title": "Medical staff"}, {"id": "1ef401ee-4919-41a6-9265-0f28c1c5c5a5", "type": "concept", "title": "Program staff"}, {"id": "5a69eff5-2815-40be-8063-611048d7f349", "type": "concept", "title": "Vacancy rates"}, {"id": "70823c66-230a-41ce-86f1-f8e0d2e14653", "type": "concept", "title": "Overtime"}, {"id": "1b5c0c89-5e65-4ca1-8023-ca930fc7dcc8", "type": "concept", "title": "Staff wellness"}, {"id": "3ac17651-10e9-4211-af7b-dc51856ccd64", "type": "concept", "title": "Burnout"}, {"id": "17d098ef-f3c4-46b2-8f0c-ea8dab28f96b", "type": "concept", "title": "Training academy"}], "description": "Correctional quality depends heavily on recruitment, training, retention, wellness, and supervision."}, {"id": "7f032ae9-45e5-481a-93aa-5113b268c78c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Security operations", "children": [{"id": "52d4394c-d75b-4546-93d6-7d8e96ab5ed1", "type": "concept", "title": "Counts"}, {"id": "8ff13cef-5e04-4779-a0a8-26bc8d5afb76", "type": "concept", "title": "Searches"}, {"id": "7dd7e60a-821c-47b7-b75b-2278e1530478", "type": "concept", "title": "Shakedowns"}, {"id": "dc63b53e-29e7-4727-8e19-c1b079416eb9", "type": "concept", "title": "Use of force"}, {"id": "632ecd76-3503-4079-9bcc-43a6a3dc6655", "type": "concept", "title": "Incident command"}, {"id": "53158a81-e2d3-4739-934d-6d0d0cccb66c", "type": "concept", "title": "Emergency response"}, {"id": "be6e15e3-2c1f-4148-8d30-886b5c841b7d", "type": "concept", "title": "Disciplinary hearings"}, {"id": "09a70058-9843-4134-8eaf-f821cb523afb", "type": "concept", "title": "Intelligence gathering"}, {"id": "5b25da81-013e-446e-9193-513c82d40932", "type": "concept", "title": "Contraband control"}], "description": "Students learn the routines that maintain safety and order inside facilities."}]}, {"id": "a0f95df4-0826-46ec-b16c-7347d6c71b33", "type": "topic", "title": "Classification, Risk-Needs Assessment, and Case Management", "description": "Classification and case planning determine where people are housed, what services they receive, and what supervision conditions they face. This unit teaches students to evaluate these tools critically.", "children": [{"id": "f3b2a2f1-3120-415a-85c1-82daa9a211f1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Custody classification", "children": [{"id": "59e6b809-7137-44dc-87c1-2a65373e6b42", "type": "concept", "title": "Initial classification"}, {"id": "942f1670-c382-45e6-9a6e-60829aa4f859", "type": "concept", "title": "Reclassification"}, {"id": "e8a0bd1b-d881-4cf0-8fe5-a088665451a4", "type": "concept", "title": "Security level"}, {"id": "329dd95b-391e-4280-8d0c-50c1f3dca7ec", "type": "concept", "title": "Escape risk"}, {"id": "dd5ada26-82bd-458a-8d6e-f2e29d1f874e", "type": "concept", "title": "Violence risk"}, {"id": "b36e95eb-27df-484f-8e10-f997ae8e7c5e", "type": "concept", "title": "Protective custody"}, {"id": "7115b80a-cd06-47e6-9bcd-ce241733eccb", "type": "concept", "title": "Special housing"}, {"id": "87eddc77-075f-4cf6-a2a7-2155d43336cd", "type": "concept", "title": "Override decisions"}], "description": "Students learn how agencies sort people by security risk, institutional needs, and housing constraints."}, {"id": "1c0254e4-0b2b-4c24-b64c-3b3fa6a8418d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk-needs-responsivity model", "children": [{"id": "a51bcff8-8f88-48d7-8c1e-ff8e77b6809f", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk principle"}, {"id": "6cd5156a-dbd2-4350-a42e-99141f9878ed", "type": "concept", "title": "Need principle"}, {"id": "3292e8fe-17a2-41f6-bb98-1800ee915a1a", "type": "concept", "title": "Responsivity principle"}, {"id": "945901da-6b95-4dd6-9db9-2cac450df70c", "type": "concept", "title": "Static factors"}, {"id": "8eba2157-0eda-402d-811b-b452098d27bc", "type": "concept", "title": "Dynamic factors"}, {"id": "d9072cdc-e8a9-4090-a604-92504c8875c5", "type": "concept", "title": "Criminogenic needs"}, {"id": "aaa795d4-5005-4b0c-8819-73dc21d26d3a", "type": "concept", "title": "Protective factors"}, {"id": "be30af7c-f658-45c4-9a4a-ec1c864a9d0c", "type": "concept", "title": "Case plan"}], "description": "The goal is to understand evidence-based correctional assessment and its limits."}, {"id": "d651bd3e-115b-47be-86d2-8a84245373c6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Equity and validation", "children": [{"id": "711ddaba-e975-4cbb-ab59-20ba2af383a6", "type": "concept", "title": "Validation"}, {"id": "ce69660f-4c40-44e1-b970-cb921b169b14", "type": "concept", "title": "Predictive accuracy"}, {"id": "912143a6-b9c1-4f85-b5fe-4a4f72dc3a6d", "type": "concept", "title": "False positives"}, {"id": "33c2efcb-8e14-4d94-8557-275ca3961115", "type": "concept", "title": "False negatives"}, {"id": "36fb671d-c3ee-4b08-b663-f36eb51c81c0", "type": "concept", "title": "Racial bias"}, {"id": "4e0eccca-8f3e-4626-9ea5-3f33b1adb26f", "type": "concept", "title": "Gender responsiveness"}, {"id": "8b103045-31e9-485e-81cb-b74dd420b151", "type": "concept", "title": "Due process"}, {"id": "cd38b626-f3b8-4f77-8557-8f1b7b5f708e", "type": "concept", "title": "Human override"}], "description": "Students learn why assessment tools must be tested for accuracy, bias, transparency, and local fit."}]}, {"id": "8c93b3e9-17b5-4c86-8965-7da87e39afc3", "type": "topic", "title": "Probation, Parole, and Community Corrections", "description": "Most people under correctional control are supervised in the community rather than confined in prison. This unit examines supervision as both social control and service delivery.", "children": [{"id": "68359877-3779-4d29-bc4a-f6fa7e5da895", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Probation and parole foundations", "children": [{"id": "4a892e9b-3a91-4262-b03a-316630eb5645", "type": "concept", "title": "Probation sentence"}, {"id": "6531cc2f-8dc3-4e64-b385-97d964570e56", "type": "concept", "title": "Parole release"}, {"id": "32878894-6b7e-42e9-84ab-4fef7c9f43c1", "type": "concept", "title": "Post-release supervision"}, {"id": "3f621722-dcb7-4d65-84c6-8b1144bdb318", "type": "concept", "title": "Mandatory supervision"}, {"id": "b67122fb-5016-4cff-92d6-7dea07cab6cd", "type": "concept", "title": "Parole boards"}, {"id": "2da2469f-5302-4296-97e9-b29ba48b527c", "type": "concept", "title": "Supervision conditions"}, {"id": "5efb117c-a7ee-4fcf-bbde-067b0b0b3e75", "type": "concept", "title": "Caseloads"}, {"id": "73f53fa2-2577-46ea-a7ff-53c253fb8cf7", "type": "concept", "title": "Technical violations"}], "description": "Students learn the differences among probation, parole, and other supervision statuses."}, {"id": "36129ee9-9b50-4df4-86a9-344bd52c7d56", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Supervision practice", "children": [{"id": "c170c1ad-18bc-49b7-883d-3a22b3663d25", "type": "concept", "title": "Home visits"}, {"id": "632d4ba5-efb6-47c3-b890-48d22716d618", "type": "concept", "title": "Office contacts"}, {"id": "742b9acb-308b-4989-9f18-ad34f79152e6", "type": "concept", "title": "Drug testing"}, {"id": "e29ca09b-38dc-46c6-808f-5931983ac7fd", "type": "concept", "title": "Electronic monitoring"}, {"id": "1ebbcb24-d0a5-424e-b908-df91f628004c", "type": "concept", "title": "Graduated sanctions"}, {"id": "0a1556ee-0bb1-48a3-a480-5c8f43cfd898", "type": "concept", "title": "Incentives"}, {"id": "56c52d6d-c65e-4fe4-8c93-00fd6cdc9bbf", "type": "concept", "title": "Motivational interviewing"}, {"id": "7c61149d-9005-4343-8a0d-c7db3da2b9f9", "type": "concept", "title": "Swift, certain, and fair sanctions"}], "description": "Students examine what officers do and how supervision can either support change or deepen system involvement."}, {"id": "7ee9ea93-af48-4342-8315-4c404cc48e51", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Community correctional options", "children": [{"id": "b3e66d7c-e9f4-4a5a-841c-7757a7d328f9", "type": "concept", "title": "Day reporting centers"}, {"id": "8a8bc456-6514-4963-b47d-d08fa91fa326", "type": "concept", "title": "Halfway houses"}, {"id": "dfb8194e-0d64-4510-bb3b-00acdceb4ae6", "type": "concept", "title": "Residential reentry centers"}, {"id": "a5b8f7e2-3ee8-438e-bfa2-209fb77d00af", "type": "concept", "title": "Work release"}, {"id": "23f566e8-9849-4215-be26-db212763f82c", "type": "concept", "title": "Problem-solving courts"}, {"id": "f68cd112-47a2-49a1-aeb0-ea201894fb47", "type": "concept", "title": "Community service"}, {"id": "5d03a30a-c224-41ee-94ba-809d062e612c", "type": "concept", "title": "Restorative programs"}, {"id": "faf55a97-1818-4ad6-a0db-70367753b7a2", "type": "concept", "title": "Treatment courts"}], "description": "The point is to understand intermediate sanctions and local alternatives to incarceration."}]}, {"id": "92b0bfc1-d54a-4bb3-808d-62f893888812", "type": "topic", "title": "Treatment, Rehabilitation, Education, and Evidence-Based Programs", "description": "Rehabilitation asks what corrections can do to reduce harm and support lawful, stable lives. Students learn to distinguish program labels from evidence-based practice.", "children": [{"id": "adcfe37f-c13f-4915-b488-2a8204d24aab", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Program types", "children": [{"id": "4a6e881c-8b39-41c6-994a-cfd9044c41ed", "type": "concept", "title": "Cognitive behavioral therapy"}, {"id": "00ab6980-01ac-4afc-b17a-95b911f16ac9", "type": "concept", "title": "Substance use treatment"}, {"id": "ae6af32e-60a4-4f78-86db-033180a36b83", "type": "concept", "title": "Educational programs"}, {"id": "837d65b3-9397-41f6-9de8-f9f86beb0a4f", "type": "concept", "title": "GED and literacy"}, {"id": "9aeae347-f216-4af1-a800-3aab575b6ff5", "type": "concept", "title": "Vocational training"}, {"id": "ac793077-9b4e-4b10-9cc6-b3e51c2b00f3", "type": "concept", "title": "College in prison"}, {"id": "6893d92d-b96d-4591-ae10-74db83c28cf2", "type": "concept", "title": "Anger management"}, {"id": "e3b6f1d0-35aa-4c51-852a-527847a74de6", "type": "concept", "title": "Family programs"}], "description": "Students learn the major categories of correctional programming and their intended outcomes."}, {"id": "2fec6b29-02a8-4388-aa91-350f29a914a7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evidence and implementation", "children": [{"id": "251746ef-312a-4d13-a2ec-d18b97df7833", "type": "concept", "title": "Program fidelity"}, {"id": "509d4d5f-3d85-40dc-9cdf-f5c44ea04de7", "type": "concept", "title": "Dosage"}, {"id": "1a70a467-7192-4c65-ba36-63b244fcb830", "type": "concept", "title": "Eligibility"}, {"id": "27345ffa-07e6-4093-b1e2-1f6ecc542cfa", "type": "concept", "title": "Completion"}, {"id": "56686f89-c8a4-4b3d-972d-1606e346432a", "type": "concept", "title": "Process evaluation"}, {"id": "c6fc0e73-02ef-4254-aafb-f7bb71ec47fc", "type": "concept", "title": "Outcome evaluation"}, {"id": "1be0420c-8985-4d86-87e6-4bf36ca3e80c", "type": "concept", "title": "Randomized trials"}, {"id": "79d5fe50-c3f8-4de7-8e06-642abe2fc760", "type": "concept", "title": "Quasi-experimental designs"}, {"id": "f31458c6-01ac-491d-9a9c-4d891839eaba", "type": "concept", "title": "CrimeSolutions ratings"}], "description": "Students learn why program quality, targeting, fidelity, and dosage matter."}, {"id": "47abb6d0-9845-4838-a1a4-56b29ca4e3d5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Barriers to access", "children": [{"id": "d6c16428-2328-40a6-88dd-76d7d000cc7f", "type": "concept", "title": "Waitlists"}, {"id": "ce7cfed6-12f0-4d93-9377-8d9549b13f87", "type": "concept", "title": "Staff shortages"}, {"id": "58680c90-cab1-4ad6-ac01-e880e4884a71", "type": "concept", "title": "Transfers"}, {"id": "8f1461b8-2214-4c9c-844c-98e8b678befc", "type": "concept", "title": "Disciplinary exclusions"}, {"id": "b766a981-c3d3-496b-9921-075f933b5b05", "type": "concept", "title": "Language access"}, {"id": "fcb51ff7-98e1-42ca-9684-54d4ce95d652", "type": "concept", "title": "Disability access"}, {"id": "2737c85a-a23c-43ce-ae4c-b00f162d99a0", "type": "concept", "title": "Technology limits"}, {"id": "8ce7d464-0947-44fd-afe0-edbbdb94562a", "type": "concept", "title": "Release timing"}], "description": "The goal is to identify practical constraints that keep programs from reaching people who need them."}]}, {"id": "a376e57a-9104-44ad-af35-679274653543", "type": "topic", "title": "Correctional Health, Mental Health, Substance Use, and Disability", "description": "Correctional systems are major providers of health, mental health, and substance use services. Students learn the legal, ethical, and operational stakes of care in custody and supervision.", "children": [{"id": "0ccacf7d-a55d-4336-a6bb-2499c517f1b6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Health care in custody", "children": [{"id": "80f97de2-5cac-4279-adf0-99dd5ba5db2f", "type": "concept", "title": "Intake screening"}, {"id": "201bcd23-9abf-4877-98a7-c179e97735f2", "type": "concept", "title": "Chronic care"}, {"id": "179bc482-2505-4446-b4e7-37d5f0269858", "type": "concept", "title": "Medication continuity"}, {"id": "5909cdc6-5d4a-4c33-b706-3dd29b1ccf57", "type": "concept", "title": "Dental care"}, {"id": "69a8f5c7-4fc4-42d1-9e94-82f0c4b1c2a6", "type": "concept", "title": "Infectious disease"}, {"id": "cd519e44-b97c-4cd7-8c58-ee33495a9ee5", "type": "concept", "title": "Pregnancy care"}, {"id": "2fb8fe69-9091-47fc-a615-9dcbb7b9e289", "type": "concept", "title": "Aging prisoners"}, {"id": "6b10b055-1707-4178-8450-a703e53476f3", "type": "concept", "title": "Telehealth"}], "description": "Students learn the basic duty to provide care and the operational challenges of doing so."}, {"id": "6d696ab6-4a99-49a7-bd60-73b46fe796e7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Mental health and suicide prevention", "children": [{"id": "71964049-bb17-4ffc-b6fb-0d2171446db4", "type": "concept", "title": "Serious mental illness"}, {"id": "b47f4e49-2897-4810-950e-9c00f8a322e1", "type": "concept", "title": "Crisis intervention"}, {"id": "b56f8de3-0f55-477a-a3bd-852f253bb27c", "type": "concept", "title": "Suicide screening"}, {"id": "2b1dd983-3a79-4e97-96f9-d35fcd39ecdd", "type": "concept", "title": "Observation cells"}, {"id": "ef361e56-6438-45a0-8299-59bef95982cc", "type": "concept", "title": "Competency issues"}, {"id": "c90f6948-3612-4959-ba7d-83e52e176f31", "type": "concept", "title": "Trauma"}, {"id": "3c5420e5-67cf-48c9-b733-e0c17b4edad9", "type": "concept", "title": "Co-occurring disorders"}, {"id": "42233f50-a002-4638-b556-7a234678e14e", "type": "concept", "title": "Discharge planning"}], "description": "The point is to connect behavioral health needs to safety, discipline, segregation, and reentry."}, {"id": "c4a0b283-c775-4440-b2b8-ba0cef080e91", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Substance use and disability", "children": [{"id": "860e3e29-1481-480f-9204-48b98e03a47a", "type": "concept", "title": "Medication-assisted treatment"}, {"id": "d9c296c5-2ad4-4d57-a055-dc3b5504cc96", "type": "concept", "title": "Opioid use disorder"}, {"id": "265c6064-2615-4a18-84d5-db8befdada7b", "type": "concept", "title": "Withdrawal management"}, {"id": "20d2c0a4-f7bb-46aa-94b6-d1bc37c925fa", "type": "concept", "title": "ADA accommodations"}, {"id": "45188db2-427a-4400-bf64-928a35d20fa5", "type": "concept", "title": "Intellectual disability"}, {"id": "6d8eaa5a-8d7b-4486-abbf-bf8748dc5530", "type": "concept", "title": "Deaf and hard of hearing access"}, {"id": "c421d9b2-822e-48d9-a0c4-760b1042b1dc", "type": "concept", "title": "Mobility access"}, {"id": "09d0caad-cf88-4bc2-8981-2639dea1147d", "type": "concept", "title": "Continuity of care"}], "description": "Students examine treatment, accommodation, and continuity of care as core correctional issues."}]}, {"id": "87f7b16e-4fba-4437-9a3c-e81b787452d4", "type": "topic", "title": "Inmate Rights, Correctional Law, and Conditions Litigation", "description": "Correctional law defines the constitutional floor under conditions of confinement and community supervision. Students learn the doctrines that govern rights, remedies, and institutional deference.", "children": [{"id": "d57a69dd-cc8f-4ce5-a7d7-3439a6e3faa0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Constitutional foundations", "children": [{"id": "0fce9ee9-607f-4530-9777-6aa725a90dce", "type": "concept", "title": "Eighth Amendment"}, {"id": "6432c9cb-34ce-4d2d-a450-995c025724e1", "type": "concept", "title": "Fourteenth Amendment"}, {"id": "186815c8-c999-4671-8f1b-a988d02ab714", "type": "concept", "title": "First Amendment"}, {"id": "5e58629d-8f71-4953-9f9b-9638bb5813bc", "type": "concept", "title": "Fourth Amendment"}, {"id": "845f1243-6555-408f-8ed4-6b2a16c870d0", "type": "concept", "title": "Due process"}, {"id": "e4282daa-7a29-4130-ac58-2e820557cc4c", "type": "concept", "title": "Equal protection"}, {"id": "9d5bc603-d23e-4d68-870c-d4aab8b7fc77", "type": "concept", "title": "Access to courts"}, {"id": "451f9fa9-0fe4-4fb0-82cd-45fa56e63325", "type": "concept", "title": "Religious exercise"}], "description": "Students learn how different amendments apply to convicted prisoners, pretrial detainees, and supervised people."}, {"id": "43deb274-784b-4a29-89a4-d1adb23167c2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Rights and restrictions", "children": [{"id": "14ab0dd1-ccc2-4f3d-bfd7-c6d4c825726e", "type": "concept", "title": "Medical care"}, {"id": "6a5cca2f-bb11-4609-9c1f-0985cf941c77", "type": "concept", "title": "Use of force"}, {"id": "114785b6-2e7f-438d-b1b3-75f22b437709", "type": "concept", "title": "Solitary confinement"}, {"id": "e5650fee-e1e4-44f2-a781-9eacddb1ae7e", "type": "concept", "title": "Discipline"}, {"id": "0be4f548-3a67-41aa-9e7d-0f903f626bcb", "type": "concept", "title": "Mail and speech"}, {"id": "8cc80d71-b8de-450e-858b-e28670cfceb0", "type": "concept", "title": "Visitation"}, {"id": "d2283e90-e493-4b2a-93b3-7da28815c2cc", "type": "concept", "title": "Searches"}, {"id": "382141f0-b8b8-412f-ac10-50dc84496c35", "type": "concept", "title": "Grievance systems"}, {"id": "fb14c0e8-ba42-4a41-b4f6-b5ae20223592", "type": "concept", "title": "Retaliation"}], "description": "The goal is to understand how courts balance institutional security against individual rights."}, {"id": "85d108d1-b711-4db7-9f31-e3388e1c2399", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Litigation and remedies", "children": [{"id": "704ed334-2c2c-4b92-bf2c-f1e34ed55131", "type": "concept", "title": "Section 1983"}, {"id": "a8f93444-bf35-4657-a83c-ceedbc27657d", "type": "concept", "title": "Bivens"}, {"id": "f1f89f1a-b095-473b-bf98-5e40ef625757", "type": "concept", "title": "PLRA exhaustion"}, {"id": "52b41b1d-f38a-4224-b0a0-7739a51fd80c", "type": "concept", "title": "Consent decrees"}, {"id": "eea76794-f5dd-4599-8ebb-dd17074a2373", "type": "concept", "title": "Injunctions"}, {"id": "2a988672-4d14-4d73-946e-142c445b7af1", "type": "concept", "title": "Damages"}, {"id": "0b0685a7-1f21-4f25-8d5b-0b18bc1b94a3", "type": "concept", "title": "Qualified immunity"}, {"id": "dad4424f-8604-4cfa-b3b6-cb866ba7169a", "type": "concept", "title": "Class actions"}, {"id": "878adfab-632e-434c-b892-1d7c656abf3f", "type": "concept", "title": "Monitoring"}], "description": "Students learn the procedural barriers and remedial tools in corrections litigation."}]}, {"id": "b57e28c3-c255-4451-a015-544ccdbc565d", "type": "topic", "title": "Safety, PREA, Use of Force, and Institutional Accountability", "description": "Safety is not only custody control; it includes protection from abuse, transparent reporting, fair investigations, and accountable uses of power. This unit centers staff and resident safety together.", "children": [{"id": "a49e073c-0e9b-48be-9b17-a30eb0e0fcdc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "PREA and sexual safety", "children": [{"id": "73631758-f66c-46fd-bb55-5d1aebd7eb19", "type": "concept", "title": "PREA standards"}, {"id": "925f30cf-40a3-49ad-a2f2-eeb6e7f0ef8f", "type": "concept", "title": "Screening"}, {"id": "3bafe59a-d2d2-4fe5-8849-ffd9846b4b5e", "type": "concept", "title": "Reporting channels"}, {"id": "997b07e2-8f65-4e40-a60c-a91119705fdd", "type": "concept", "title": "Retaliation protection"}, {"id": "91f0f84b-ad00-42a3-b299-12335e6920f1", "type": "concept", "title": "Victim services"}, {"id": "77089293-44e2-4b6b-9a52-30bf92ec72e0", "type": "concept", "title": "Investigations"}, {"id": "55d23b5a-4e8b-46df-add5-dffc33db1b01", "type": "concept", "title": "Audit instruments"}, {"id": "a684b69e-c3bc-4e23-bec0-c1636ed9628d", "type": "concept", "title": "Corrective action"}], "description": "Students learn the role of PREA standards, prevention, reporting, investigations, and audits in confinement settings."}, {"id": "91a03636-3d2b-4afb-b490-f38128b646da", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Use of force and discipline", "children": [{"id": "6e8810f4-7f21-48d6-add7-9540d4812019", "type": "concept", "title": "Continuum of force"}, {"id": "7c4711e7-360c-48dc-b0f3-8ee421f82cf6", "type": "concept", "title": "Chemical agents"}, {"id": "8f2ca974-18a8-44b3-90cf-72883de4a83f", "type": "concept", "title": "Restraints"}, {"id": "c7d0f283-06a6-43a0-9f8b-6ab1c0340098", "type": "concept", "title": "Cell extractions"}, {"id": "43c919cb-8b47-4bd7-a4af-ca19f9e0bd76", "type": "concept", "title": "Body cameras"}, {"id": "ab51ec88-719b-4853-8a8b-36b4c7159ada", "type": "concept", "title": "Incident reports"}, {"id": "43a3784f-fabd-4b63-bb61-1bab55cf0b05", "type": "concept", "title": "Disciplinary segregation"}, {"id": "9237a9fc-dcea-47c4-b846-079f28ae5d3e", "type": "concept", "title": "Due process hearings"}], "description": "The point is to evaluate when force is authorized and how agencies document, review, and reduce it."}, {"id": "f8f2ab1d-04a1-4a91-8b7a-56613854f7e5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Oversight and accountability", "children": [{"id": "0d1eaad6-c7db-4abe-96e4-95f751204dea", "type": "concept", "title": "Internal affairs"}, {"id": "2aeabe13-c5b4-4376-b615-7a4010ca63bd", "type": "concept", "title": "Inspector general"}, {"id": "54922067-b476-4896-8cd9-c082c3463580", "type": "concept", "title": "Ombuds"}, {"id": "76638256-994b-4852-8e28-57fc4a48d013", "type": "concept", "title": "Accreditation"}, {"id": "00f073c8-8334-40c6-bf97-c9088ca62e11", "type": "concept", "title": "Civilian oversight"}, {"id": "9ee99962-7041-450d-8879-598b76d9ea5d", "type": "concept", "title": "Mortality review"}, {"id": "f94095c7-bdd9-47b5-8539-db5dc56e7436", "type": "concept", "title": "Data transparency"}, {"id": "a977f1f9-90c8-4153-ac47-57df24cbba9b", "type": "concept", "title": "Whistleblower protection"}], "description": "Students learn how internal and external oversight can identify systemic problems."}]}, {"id": "95feecd9-b1df-4ad7-85fe-b4851a57b6ff", "type": "topic", "title": "Reentry, Desistance, and Recidivism", "description": "Reentry begins before release and continues after return to the community. Students learn how housing, work, supervision, family, treatment, and legal barriers shape desistance.", "children": [{"id": "c5e632ee-fd4f-4d29-aca6-fa9b451432fd", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Release planning", "children": [{"id": "b511b928-22c7-44a7-9ba2-32ade9276ac5", "type": "concept", "title": "Discharge planning"}, {"id": "0882a189-df9c-4bad-a4ec-881d4c02f243", "type": "concept", "title": "Identification documents"}, {"id": "ffc46b40-a80a-4f66-a165-4c90beab144a", "type": "concept", "title": "Medications"}, {"id": "f9a94c49-14bd-4f88-ba4e-32112aac4b64", "type": "concept", "title": "Benefits enrollment"}, {"id": "aefe352b-3800-4bf4-89b2-4eeaf55334a8", "type": "concept", "title": "Housing plan"}, {"id": "f9222a6c-4c23-4151-ac56-e601f52744f6", "type": "concept", "title": "Employment plan"}, {"id": "975063f7-56e2-43dd-a946-108292e22b91", "type": "concept", "title": "Family reunification"}, {"id": "09d6f681-0a00-4992-95ca-fc35e0819670", "type": "concept", "title": "Transportation"}], "description": "Students learn what a practical reentry plan must address before someone leaves custody."}, {"id": "0b277b28-23da-404b-a1fa-dcf8930aa9a8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Recidivism and desistance", "children": [{"id": "128bd644-8639-4db0-9af3-59e64f05895e", "type": "concept", "title": "Rearrest"}, {"id": "84c3be04-64a9-461e-8c61-68bc5a2b610d", "type": "concept", "title": "Reconviction"}, {"id": "897e0875-a592-4fd5-892d-9657a80aaf4e", "type": "concept", "title": "Reincarceration"}, {"id": "39308e25-d6f1-4a69-88cd-fe39d3c56f16", "type": "concept", "title": "Technical violation"}, {"id": "73603927-e944-410d-98ab-37806088b89e", "type": "concept", "title": "Follow-up period"}, {"id": "c49cca3d-b8fa-4f97-9452-9bfc55b4cec9", "type": "concept", "title": "Desistance"}, {"id": "81a647da-62b8-4bd7-a6c5-ab7040a56187", "type": "concept", "title": "Social bonds"}, {"id": "88b948d1-331e-49a5-922c-e130ddc6578d", "type": "concept", "title": "Identity change"}, {"id": "1c08a15a-8b3d-46db-a4c8-e026bba1d1b4", "type": "concept", "title": "Procedural justice"}], "description": "The goal is to understand recidivism metrics and the broader process of leaving crime behind."}, {"id": "f8325171-6b89-44fb-b850-33f64406a1dd", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Collateral consequences", "children": [{"id": "92c6ee4f-ad25-42a4-90fb-2791a587d336", "type": "concept", "title": "Criminal records"}, {"id": "d7ccad72-5ff7-492f-8789-d106b6e40c92", "type": "concept", "title": "Expungement"}, {"id": "4f7ff2b9-f92c-4781-b8f4-6d3cc9489c08", "type": "concept", "title": "Occupational licensing"}, {"id": "d12b1003-ac36-498c-9808-833af32e1369", "type": "concept", "title": "Voting rights"}, {"id": "6d1f8f6f-e372-4eb7-b7c4-0adc1e8c74e0", "type": "concept", "title": "Public housing"}, {"id": "82f0a8a4-df28-42a2-bc0c-273fe435fcb5", "type": "concept", "title": "Student aid"}, {"id": "dfd09b4c-698e-4583-9bef-3c5a15d35b60", "type": "concept", "title": "Child support"}, {"id": "2a3ce95c-9ae6-4d0a-a0df-bf3dab7fa920", "type": "concept", "title": "Driver licenses"}], "description": "Students examine how legal and social barriers can undermine reintegration."}]}, {"id": "67552458-ca16-491b-9426-d127b4d26f8b", "type": "topic", "title": "Special Populations, Equity, and Human Dignity", "description": "Correctional systems house and supervise people with very different risks, needs, histories, and legal protections. This unit pushes students to think beyond average cases.", "children": [{"id": "e8c623d9-4e08-41bf-91cf-109040f31378", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Race, ethnicity, class, and geography", "children": [{"id": "b8718a22-d5c2-46d9-85ab-7c8a9aa3f260", "type": "concept", "title": "Racial disparity"}, {"id": "733e63dc-9883-4523-8048-806909085965", "type": "concept", "title": "Native and tribal justice"}, {"id": "63d65058-fc5d-46da-8ea2-7ddd831c639b", "type": "concept", "title": "Rural corrections"}, {"id": "0979a7e4-f751-459c-84a0-d80f4e6b285e", "type": "concept", "title": "Urban jail systems"}, {"id": "476c8239-ec7f-480b-864a-4698a1e1f422", "type": "concept", "title": "Poverty"}, {"id": "9302cb8c-38f4-451b-b593-4dbe086821ae", "type": "concept", "title": "Fines and fees"}, {"id": "2580aafd-a6a7-412c-bf32-81ea087b4b88", "type": "concept", "title": "Language access"}, {"id": "fd9bcdfa-59c2-4feb-b146-6a80e1ca703d", "type": "concept", "title": "Immigration status"}], "description": "Students examine how inequality appears in admission, classification, discipline, programming, release, and supervision outcomes."}, {"id": "9520f702-c8ba-4038-884c-e87caca6ed03", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Gender, sexuality, and family status", "children": [{"id": "5756cb64-315b-4e57-85d4-6154ba405e0f", "type": "concept", "title": "Women in custody"}, {"id": "6f0f0557-71e1-48c1-82ad-6eaf8dd27a16", "type": "concept", "title": "Pregnancy"}, {"id": "5b37747b-b0f3-4804-a7bb-9618e42b96a3", "type": "concept", "title": "Parenting programs"}, {"id": "4c3cd1a6-3e15-40b7-b7d3-bcf2a69320ad", "type": "concept", "title": "Transgender people"}, {"id": "0a1b9d1a-6521-4540-879e-cbf014e061f6", "type": "concept", "title": "LGBTQ+ safety"}, {"id": "599b67d0-e2e1-40a5-ad47-ff94edecaf74", "type": "concept", "title": "Search policies"}, {"id": "eb14fcbb-c142-46fe-9df6-f7f5323f8e22", "type": "concept", "title": "Housing decisions"}, {"id": "42bb2b42-0c1a-4ff7-ab60-b903a031180f", "type": "concept", "title": "Family contact"}], "description": "The goal is to understand gender-responsive and LGBTQ+ responsive correctional practice."}, {"id": "c2cadca6-ac72-4e12-9708-3a66517c2e5d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Age, disability, and vulnerability", "children": [{"id": "c0815caa-7cf3-4802-ab16-35042de47777", "type": "concept", "title": "Youth in adult facilities"}, {"id": "3bab3fc1-8f48-45fb-bdfa-be7bf3b63056", "type": "concept", "title": "Emerging adults"}, {"id": "6962036c-f3e6-4b18-96f9-f0a3ec8bb28e", "type": "concept", "title": "Older prisoners"}, {"id": "4dbe5354-bd2f-495f-abd4-0760b1626c63", "type": "concept", "title": "Disability accommodations"}, {"id": "54fcab38-95f6-4193-85ac-e46576b9d40e", "type": "concept", "title": "Protective custody"}, {"id": "9c026ec4-528b-49ce-85be-ced5fcec0b88", "type": "concept", "title": "Victimization risk"}, {"id": "0c6b1fc0-cdae-4272-a855-2c82be1fdf93", "type": "concept", "title": "Long-term care"}, {"id": "9ccbdce6-3d82-4c5d-8af5-039499e5d2ec", "type": "concept", "title": "Compassionate release"}], "description": "Students learn how age and vulnerability change risk, care, safety, and release planning."}]}, {"id": "79834157-1665-47d9-82bc-c35833884f9c", "type": "topic", "title": "Capital Punishment, Life Sentences, and Extreme Punishment", "description": "Capital punishment and life sentences reveal the sharpest moral, legal, racial, and administrative questions in corrections. Students study both death penalty systems and long-term confinement.", "children": [{"id": "81bc43de-01bc-4cb4-baf2-e5c5cfd26510", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Capital punishment process", "children": [{"id": "e29683e6-cdb5-4f2c-b91e-17beacbc0143", "type": "concept", "title": "Capital charging"}, {"id": "2fd0a6de-0825-4c74-9cb7-3dae56dc977c", "type": "concept", "title": "Aggravating factors"}, {"id": "e1978ff2-d299-482c-8f17-514603ebe2d5", "type": "concept", "title": "Mitigating evidence"}, {"id": "23f59415-4522-4275-9625-ac4affbcd259", "type": "concept", "title": "Penalty phase"}, {"id": "79cc98fd-c6ee-4dd7-826b-8f147f249a32", "type": "concept", "title": "Direct appeal"}, {"id": "a79f1b6b-effd-4d6a-8320-f74f452e3034", "type": "concept", "title": "Post-conviction review"}, {"id": "0110401b-1443-44fe-9e50-f9fc1c9cb7d7", "type": "concept", "title": "Habeas corpus"}, {"id": "0d8e2fdb-e15e-4dec-8003-98de785214e0", "type": "concept", "title": "Execution protocols"}], "description": "Students learn the stages and legal safeguards in American death penalty administration."}, {"id": "21182a0b-ad75-4593-af1d-a490323e447f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Death row and execution administration", "children": [{"id": "c641c3ee-2338-4c26-a8ae-ac2dce83be1e", "type": "concept", "title": "Death row housing"}, {"id": "a78d084f-d758-4861-b6ac-98e47abe1989", "type": "concept", "title": "Isolation"}, {"id": "ec5ffb2a-62fd-4e79-9627-5f3a19a51e54", "type": "concept", "title": "Spiritual advisors"}, {"id": "33518bb5-92ac-459a-bcca-990b12271f38", "type": "concept", "title": "Medical ethics"}, {"id": "9881d3c9-7ef0-465d-a041-3fd8101c585b", "type": "concept", "title": "Lethal injection"}, {"id": "eb84a2d2-823f-456e-bc6e-df36522d7478", "type": "concept", "title": "Victim family notification"}, {"id": "0fb8696a-60a2-46ab-bcbe-8ec4ff9eda6c", "type": "concept", "title": "Last statements"}, {"id": "5c61c51a-7393-43f4-9a23-bda08da5000b", "type": "concept", "title": "Execution witnesses"}], "description": "The point is to understand how capital punishment becomes a correctional management problem."}, {"id": "4e98a1d3-df8c-4e7b-b98f-d43667176918", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Life and long-term sentences", "children": [{"id": "f456d589-5c9d-4e5f-886a-62b58effebfc", "type": "concept", "title": "Life without parole"}, {"id": "3bb37ace-8a92-4d64-9457-f44f9f75035a", "type": "concept", "title": "Virtual life sentences"}, {"id": "b542ca0b-a704-4afb-a85e-995de8fe2fe4", "type": "concept", "title": "Juvenile life cases"}, {"id": "30023790-0a46-4170-b9b8-a8914b3bd005", "type": "concept", "title": "Parole eligibility"}, {"id": "d1233d0c-47fe-4ced-824f-625278e35f43", "type": "concept", "title": "Geriatric release"}, {"id": "6118b0b4-c9e4-4501-99a5-88f4fffe8f23", "type": "concept", "title": "Clemency"}, {"id": "5c0b9649-aa3c-43bd-ab32-729a834a33fb", "type": "concept", "title": "Mercy"}, {"id": "e645cc58-2daa-42b9-8332-781e1c180925", "type": "concept", "title": "Proportionality"}], "description": "Students examine extreme punishment beyond the death penalty."}]}, {"id": "5f6815dc-5dde-4a4d-a8b4-ddec04049fbb", "type": "topic", "title": "Ethics, Professional Identity, and Correctional Leadership", "description": "Corrections professionals exercise coercive authority in closed institutions and under public scrutiny. This unit treats ethics as a daily practice, not a final-week add-on.", "children": [{"id": "a2303557-8636-43ae-8981-7b4c93d85996", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Correctional ethics", "children": [{"id": "c78db853-1df9-4ebf-8c09-a9373ede2afb", "type": "concept", "title": "Discretion"}, {"id": "36ea745b-9609-4856-a2bd-78cd68e17337", "type": "concept", "title": "Boundary violations"}, {"id": "2338e766-4be8-4188-ac3c-d918e7d4d464", "type": "concept", "title": "Contraband"}, {"id": "c43692d2-4e07-4720-af7c-38b8253db747", "type": "concept", "title": "Favoritism"}, {"id": "7f8ec98e-d15c-4bbb-a473-e748706160c6", "type": "concept", "title": "Corruption"}, {"id": "d035b322-3603-4fce-854a-c5f4f180b37e", "type": "concept", "title": "Code of silence"}, {"id": "0cd7df05-872e-4982-922d-ed200231fc00", "type": "concept", "title": "Dual loyalty"}, {"id": "85ac5eb9-e3ae-45b9-8786-53897cbca7b3", "type": "concept", "title": "Professional integrity"}], "description": "Students learn the ethical dilemmas created by discretion, secrecy, force, scarcity, and institutional loyalty."}, {"id": "1dc32243-3e48-4635-b79f-2faf9ee51ac4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Leadership and culture", "children": [{"id": "ea628511-622c-4661-954f-924bf9e4eb0d", "type": "concept", "title": "Organizational culture"}, {"id": "039f6d8b-10c3-4d94-ac43-a0fda8e8925e", "type": "concept", "title": "Procedural justice"}, {"id": "8021b898-5742-487e-85dd-0b463126267e", "type": "concept", "title": "Trauma-informed leadership"}, {"id": "8c049c0d-d234-40dc-900d-7117b5c145e5", "type": "c